        "TileImage": "$($repository c823beec-3d73-47b6-87d9-076c384c4662).Image",
        "Description": "Good day 47. We have a contract from the famous Mario, who would like us to frame his brother Luigi.\rLuigi has started to take the spotlight away from his brother and our client would like to end all ties with the younger brother.\rBut he needs his brother to be hated so you will unfortunately take out some others with him to taint the Luigi name.\rThis will be a interesting visit to the mushroom kingdom. I will now leave you to prepear.",
